    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Version header",
      "Anchor": "version-header",
      "SectionPath": [
        "How versioning works",
        "Version header"
      ],
      "Text": "All requests must include the LinkedIn-Version header. The value identifies the API version and uses YYYYMM format for standard releases or YYYYMM.xx for patch releases.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "code",
      "Section": "Version header",
      "Anchor": "version-header",
      "SectionPath": [
        "How versioning works",
        "Version header"
      ],
      "Text": "-H \u0027LinkedIn-Version: 202604\u0027",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Version and base path",
      "Anchor": "version-and-base-path",
      "SectionPath": [
        "How versioning works",
        "Version and base path"
      ],
      "Text": "Versioned APIs use the https://api.linkedin.com/rest/ base path. Legacy unversioned APIs use https://api.linkedin.com/v2/. As versioned replacements are released, the corresponding legacy endpoints will be sunset.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Release cadence",
      "Anchor": "release-cadence",
      "SectionPath": [
        "How versioning works",
        "Release cadence"
      ],
      "Text": "LinkedIn publishes new API versions as updates are ready. Patch versions (e.g., 202508.02) are issued for critical security, privacy, or bug fixes only.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Support window",
      "Anchor": "support-window",
      "SectionPath": [
        "How versioning works",
        "Support window"
      ],
      "Text": "Each version is supported for a minimum of 2 years from its release date. You can stay on any supported version within that window, but migrating to the latest version gives you the longest support window and access to all new features.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Versioned API docs",
      "Anchor": "versioned-api-docs",
      "SectionPath": [
        "How versioning works",
        "Versioned API docs"
      ],
      "Text": "Use the version dropdown selector to view the API updates applicable to a specific version.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
