      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Migrating between versions",
      "Anchor": "migrating-between-versions",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Migrating between versions"
      ],
      "Text": "When migrating between REST API versions, update the LinkedIn-Version header value to the target version. No URL changes are required unless an endpoint path itself changed (see the API Version History table above). When migrating from legacy https://api.linkedin.com/v2/ endpoints, you must also update the base path to https://api.linkedin.com/rest/ and, in some cases, use updated endpoint paths.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "code",
      "Section": "Migrating between versions",
      "Anchor": "migrating-between-versions",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Migrating between versions"
      ],
      "Text": "# Before\n-H \u0027LinkedIn-Version: 202510\u0027\n\n# After\n-H \u0027LinkedIn-Version: 202604\u0027",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Migrating between versions",
      "Anchor": "migrating-between-versions",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Migrating between versions"
      ],
      "Text": "Review the Summary of Changes column in the API version history table for each version between your current and target version to identify any new required fields or endpoint changes.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Breaking change policy",
      "Anchor": "breaking-change-policy",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Migrating between versions",
        "Breaking change policy"
      ],
      "Text": "LinkedIn may release a patch version to address critical security, privacy, or bug fix issues. These cases are rare, and LinkedIn works closely with partners to minimize disruption when they occur.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "What happens if I use a sunset version?",
      "Anchor": "what-happens-if-i-use-a-sunset-version",
      "SectionPath": [
        "FAQ",
        "What happens if I use a sunset version?"
      ],
      "Text": "Requests will return a 426 Upgrade Required error:",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
